cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this work, please cite it as below."
title: "Consistent Context Kit"
abstract: >-
  A three-tier, token-efficient context system for AI coding agents, plus a
  pre-registered controlled study of access-pattern-tiered context. Extends the
  ETH "Evaluating AGENTS.md" negative result with real SWE-bench test-execution
  grading and from-scratch statistics (McNemar, bootstrap CIs, non-inferiority,
  Cochran-Mantel-Haenszel, stratified permutation).
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: Purnima
    family-names: Pathak
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0000-6441-7962"
keywords:
  - llm agents
  - context engineering
  - reliable information synthesis
  - swe-bench
license-url: "https://github.com/pupa3066/context-configuration-builder/blob/main/LICENSE"
repository-code: "https://github.com/pupa3066/context-configuration-builder"
